# The Emissary Windurst 2 (Bastok 2-3, mission.bastok.the_emissary_windurst2). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok in Port
# Windurst with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out). Status 0:
# neither arm answers, so the zone defaults play (Ada 44, Gold Skull 43, Josef 45, Melek 42). Status 7: Ada 63, Gold
# Skull 62, Josef 65, Melek 64. Status 8: Gold Skull and Melek answer messages, no event; Ada falls back to her
# default 44. Status 9: Gold Skull 57; Melek has no crest and plays her default 42. With the Kindred Crest: Melek 66,
# whose finish completes the mission, begins The Emissary, takes the crest, moves to status 10 and gives the Kindred
# Report; The Emissary's own script then answers Melek 67 and Gold Skull 68.
lists BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/242 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/244 PortWindurst/Ada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gold_Skull/onTrigger PortWindurst/Josef/onTrigger PortWindurst/Melek/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/66
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-80,-5,158 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissaryWindurst2 current
login
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Josef
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 7
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Josef
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 8
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 9
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
keyitem KindredCrest
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
finish
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
